Subject: [PATCH 4/5] shcore: Implement SHCreateStreamOnModuleResourceW.

Also export it from shlwapi as ordinal 628, which mstsc.exe imports to
load "Image" resources for its connection dialog. Without it the import
is unresolved and mstsc passes a NULL stream to WIC and crashes.
